  data: {
    LLM: 'Deal 10 cards to each player and 2 face-down to the prikup. Players bid by passing or naming a trump suit (Paston, Glitch, Dineri, Gupa, Paston grkha). Highest bidder becomes declarer, takes the prikup, discards two cards, and names trump. Declarer must take at least six tricks. Opponents may say whist (defend) or pass. Play: declarer leads; follow suit if possible, otherwise play a trump. Highest trump or highest card of led suit wins the trick; winner leads next. Scores are cumulative; game ends at 121 points.',
    Player: 'Deal 10 cards to each player and 2 face-down to the prikup. Players bid by passing or naming a trump suit (Paston, Glitch, Dineri, Gupa, Paston grkha). Highest bidder becomes declarer, takes the prikup, discards two cards, and names trump. Declarer must take at least six tricks. Opponents may say whist (defend) or pass. Play: declarer leads; follow suit if possible, otherwise play a trump. Highest trump or highest card of led suit wins the trick; winner leads next. Scores are cumulative; game ends at 121 points.',
    objective: 'Be the first player to reach 121 cumulative points.',
    gameplay: 'Deal 10 cards to each player and 2 face-down to the prikup. Players bid by passing or naming a trump suit (Paston, Glitch, Dineri, Gupa, Paston grkha). Highest bidder becomes declarer, takes the prikup, discards two cards, and names trump. Declarer must take at least six tricks. Opponents may say whist (defend) or pass. Play: declarer leads; follow suit if possible, otherwise play a trump. Highest trump or highest card of led suit wins the trick; winner leads next. Scores are cumulative; game ends at 121 points.',
    keyRules: [
      'Follow suit if possible; if void, must play a trump.',
      'Declarer must take at least six tricks or scores penalty.',
      'Trump ranking: Paston (spades) lowest, then Glitch, Dineri, Gupa, Paston grkha (best spades) highest.',
      'When all pass in bidding, holder of Jack of spades (or 7 of spades if Jack in prikup) becomes declarer.',
    ],
